correction={'questionId':'W05-L23-Q028','recordedAt':now,'authorKeysSeenAtCorrection':True,'blindAnswersSha256':sha(ap),'correction':'The frozen answer correctly chose o1 and found 6.1 N, but the reviewer transcribed the spring product as 1*0.5 instead of the actual question values 5*0.1. Both products equal 0.5 N. The actual complete calculation is 2*3 + 0.4*sign(-2) + 5*0.1 = 6.1 N. The original frozen response and pre-reveal check are retained unchanged. This is a reviewer provenance correction, not an author defect or a changed option selection.','actualPostRevealCalculation':2*3-.4+5*.1}
