 reason+=' All 32 source pages were personally inspected at actual 1800-pixel resolution before freezing these 62 responses. Independent checks passed 39 exact/numeric assertions, a separately reconstructed 801-sample ODE comparison and 500 randomized trials with three model-cancellation checks each before author-key access. Every intended key matches the frozen independent selection; matching keys do not override quality defects. All option explanations, formula definitions/units/conditions, assumptions, citation scope, difficulty and duplication were assessed after reveal. '+('The listed defects block approval of this exact object.' if q['id'] in flags else 'All nine quality criteria pass for this exact version; this does not certify complete lecture or course coverage.')
